# Legacy media excluded from the public repository (Phase 7B).
#
# None of these is referenced by src/, index.html, the build, or any of the
# generation scripts in scripts/ — verified against optimize-images.mjs
# SOURCES, generate-favicon.mjs, generate-og-image.mjs and
# src/assets/optimized/manifest.json. They are recovery-archive files only.
#
# They remain on disk and in the external backup; nothing is deleted. The rest
# of img/ IS tracked, because it is the source-master bank the image, favicon
# and OG-image workflows read.

